fixture air_dash_up_1to2_ramp_rows
doc docs/adr/0008 decision 6 (round 3, H1): a hop then a level air dash right onto a three-row 1:2 ramp (test/review_ramp12), which it climbs without stopping at a row boundary.
room test/review_ramp12
spawn 236 384
frames 30
input
  0 R jump
  1 R dash
  2..29 R
end
expect
  # 180 u in 9 f, every frame 20 u: the ramp changes no speed.
  at 9 xu=417 state=dash
  never 1..10 hit_wall!=0
end
